Third-party notices for Personal Ledger
=======================================

Personal Ledger is released under the MIT licence (see LICENSE). This file lists the third-party
software compiled into this build, with the licence text each crate is used under. It is
generated from Cargo.lock by cargo-about (see about.toml); do not edit it by hand.

Each crate is listed under the licence it is used under. Where a crate offers a choice of
licences, the first one allowed by about.toml is used. Crates that publish no licence file are
listed with the standard text of their licence, without an author's copyright line.

